{"unit_id":"kenryu42__cc-safety-net#card-zh","repo":"kenryu42/cc-safety-net","commit":"6f34af1f777ba28d331b7809a2bb087a001d353d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"CC Safety Net（DSH 插件，命令行客户端）：在编码代理调用工具前检查命令和文件访问，拦截危险操作。它通过 hook 接入编码代理，提供破坏性 Git 与文件系统命令拦截、敏感文件访问防护及本地审计记录，适合希望在代理工具执行前增加安全检查的开发者。无需额外 API 密钥，配置详见文档。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/audit/writer.ts:134-140","package.json:1"]}
{"unit_id":"kenryu42__cc-safety-net#card-en","repo":"kenryu42/cc-safety-net","commit":"6f34af1f777ba28d331b7809a2bb087a001d353d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"CC Safety Net checks commands and file access before coding agents invoke tools. Hooks connect it to agents. It blocks destructive Git and filesystem commands, guards sensitive files, and records decisions locally. It suits developers seeking a check before agent actions; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/audit/writer.ts:134-140","package.json:1"]}
